---
const { version } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section" id="whats-new">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="whats-new-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">What's new</h2>
      <span class="version-pill">{version}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="new-grid">
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">Email Detail Overhaul</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">Toggle between grouped Conversation view and expanded Message Chain view. Share any email as a beautifully rendered image, force light mode for HTML content, and collapse long quoted replies by default.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M17 3a2.85 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z"/>
            <path d="m15 5 4 4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">Compose Redesign</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">Floating bottom dock puts Send, Schedule, and Attach in your thumb zone. Contact avatars in autocomplete, an auto-grow body editor, and a full formatting toolbar for rich emails.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">Parallel Sync &amp; Performance</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">All accounts sync concurrently instead of one at a time. Outlook sync is 5-10x faster thanks to concurrent API calls. Bounded memory keeps the app responsive on large mailboxes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">Settings Overhaul</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">New hub-and-spoke settings with category cards, spring animations, and peak-end footer. Animated theme toggle, templates management, and a dedicated support section with Ko-fi and Discord.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8"/><path d="M12 17v4"/><path d="M2 10h20"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">HTML Email Improvements</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">Safer rendering with a built-in HTML sanitizer that strips unsafe content. Better dark mode support via colour-scheme media queries, consistent typography, and smoother scrolling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new-card">
        <div class="new-card-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M12 8v4"/><path d="M12 16h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-card-name">Stability &amp; Bug Fixes</div>
        <p class="new-card-desc">Unified inbox crash fixed, Outlook token refresh corrected, late email notifications resolved, system font option added, and PGP detection hardened against false positives on calendar invites.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
